"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOctober 2026, around autumn, here is the Mushroom Postcard in Odense, Region of Southern Denmark.  \n\nMario is smiling broadly against the background of the sky.\n\nWith his red cap and mustache, he looks like he popped right out of a fairy tale.\n\nThe Pikmin standing next to him also wears a Mario cap, blending in perfectly. It feels as if childhood memories of the game are returning through a single postcard.\n\n\n\n\n"